{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0cb5c692-fde0-8c24-b034-bbf9bc1d10f4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T13:50:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula R. Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:45:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. I am calling about a streetlight. I have it written here, so I read slowly, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. What's going on with the light?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The light in front of my house, it goes on and off. On and off. It flickers all night long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's flickering through the night. Is it on during the day too, or only after dark?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I cannot hear you well. Can you hold the phone closer to your mouth, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, is that better? I asked if it only flickers after dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a little better. Only at night. In the day I do not see. At night it flickers, then it is dark, then it is on again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address where the pole is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is fifty-four Kingston Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-four Kingston Avenue. That's up on the Hill, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, again please. Closer to the phone, I am not hearing the last part. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said, that's in the Historic Hill area? Can you hear me now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes, Historic Hill. Fifty-four Kingston Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Is the pole right in front of your house, or is it next door or across the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One moment, I look at my paper. [pause] It is the pole in front of my house, by the sidewalk. I am the homeowner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you see a number on the pole, like a little tag or sticker? Sometimes there's one at about eye level."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:48:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not have it. I did not go outside to look. It is cold. I can look later and call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:48:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, you don't need to. The address will do. I'll put it in as a flickering light at the pole in front of fifty-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I want to ask, please, for a crew to come and check the pole. Check the light and the wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send the request over so a crew can look at the pole and the fixture. They'll check it out in the order the requests come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, can you say again? The phone is far. [inaudible]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hold on, I'll speak up. I said the request goes to the crew, and they'll come look at it. I can't tell you the exact day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. Is it a few days, or more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days to a couple weeks, depending on how busy they are. If it goes fully dark, or you see sparking or a wire down, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. If it is dark, I call again. If sparks, I call again. I write it here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:49:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Can I get a phone number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-zero-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paula Teixeira. T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A. Paula R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Paula Teixeira. You're all set. The request is in for the flickering streetlight at fifty-four Kingston Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. That is all I needed. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Paula. Enjoy your weekend. Bye now."
    }
  ],
